# Fleet Manager licence server - Caddy (HTTPS front door).
# Goes in: /etc/caddy/Caddyfile   (install.sh fills in your address and puts it there for you)
# Caddy gets and renews the HTTPS certificate by itself. It sends the buyer's real IP to the
# licence server in X-Forwarded-For; the server only believes that header from 127.0.0.1 (Caddy).

licence.YOURDOMAIN.com {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8750
}
